    {
      "filename": "Impressive red-gold art work above the main entrance (14604866122).jpg",
      "title": "File:Impressive red-gold art work above the main entrance (14604866122).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cf/Impressive_red-gold_art_work_above_the_main_entrance_%2814604866122%29.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Impressive_red-gold_art_work_above_the_main_entrance_(14604866122).jpg",
      "width": 4288,
      "height": 2848,
      "mime": "image/jpeg",
      "license": "CC BY 2.0",
      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0",
      "artist": "shankar s. from Dubai, united arab emirates",
      "description": "Something I found downright bugging all over Laos, you are not allowed to take pictures inside wats and museums. Likewise, while you were welcome to snap pictures outside this wat, located at the entrance to the LP National Museum, you were not allowed to take pictures inside. I did try zooming in from the outside, but the tropical heat and glare was a little too much, even at that early hour, and the contrast was too extreme to yield a good photograph. So here is some gorgeous red-gold Buddhist artwork (this classic colour combo appeared to be standard in all was in Laos) on the ceiling and walls of the external walkways around the wat. (Luang Prabang, Laos/ Lao PDR, April 2014)",
      "dateCreated": "2014-04-01 00:00",
      "sourceType": "commons-category",
      "sourceArticleId": "royal-palace-luang-prabang-wp",
      "sourceGeohash4": "w789",
      "mediumPath": "_m/w/7/8/9/royal-palace-luang-prabang-wp/impressive-red-gold-art-work-a-medium.webp",
      "smallPath": "_m/w/7/8/9/royal-palace-luang-prabang-wp/impressive-red-gold-art-work-a-small.webp"
    },
    {
      "filename": "A closer view of the red-gold artwork (14604867802).jpg",
      "title": "File:A closer view of the red-gold artwork (14604867802).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/84/A_closer_view_of_the_red-gold_artwork_%2814604867802%29.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:A_closer_view_of_the_red-gold_artwork_(14604867802).jpg",
      "width": 4288,
      "height": 2848,
      "mime": "image/jpeg",
      "license": "CC BY 2.0",
      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0",
      "artist": "shankar s. from Dubai, united arab emirates",
      "description": "A closer view of the gorgeous red-gold Buddhist art on the ceiling and walls of the external walkways around the beautiful wat located right inside the gates of the LP National Museum. Most of these bas reliefs appear to depict various aspects of the life of the Buddha. (Luang Prabang, Laos/ Lao PDR, April 2014)",
      "dateCreated": "2014-04-01 00:00",
      "sourceType": "commons-category",
      "sourceArticleId": "royal-palace-luang-prabang-wp",
      "sourceGeohash4": "w789",
